Z||000002||mrfiero||11-15-2001||01:39 PM||||The problem is you are asking for something that may not even exist, or if it does in very small numbers.  <P>Yellow was only offered in '88, so you need to find someone who has repainted their Fiero.  After finding a yellow '85 GT (or other aero-notchback) the odds of it having T-Tops are very slim.  So trying to find someone who has a yellow aero-notchback with T-Tops won't be easy.<P>I know where there is a red '85 GT with T-Tops, but that won't do you any good. <BR> ||||reg||1
